{
  "beats": [
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/a27eb88f4de9.mp3",
      "hash": "a27eb88f4de9",
      "vo": "Why do some men look better with a moustache?",
      "seconds": 2.168163,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.188
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/087e67644e10.mp3",
      "hash": "087e67644e10",
      "vo": "While others with one just end up looking creepy?",
      "seconds": 2.220408,
      "lead": 0.032,
      "trail": 0.209
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/7610bd907657.mp3",
      "hash": "7610bd907657",
      "vo": "A moustache sits on your upper lip, so a long lip gives it room.",
      "seconds": 3.291429,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.228
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/4cee099aafc2.mp3",
      "hash": "4cee099aafc2",
      "vo": "It fills the gap between a strong nose and a strong chin.",
      "seconds": 2.821224,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.16
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/01de428677d3.mp3",
      "hash": "01de428677d3",
      "vo": "Pick your shape first: a pencil leaves the lip bare.",
      "seconds": 3.056327,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.284
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/b6c534dc2907.mp3",
      "hash": "b6c534dc2907",
      "vo": "A horseshoe drops past the mouth and lengthens the whole face.",
      "seconds": 2.873469,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.165
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/1d7229d3f4fc.mp3",
      "hash": "1d7229d3f4fc",
      "vo": "A chevron follows the lip line and keeps everything level.",
      "seconds": 2.690612,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.229
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/d55bb80a4260.mp3",
      "hash": "d55bb80a4260",
      "vo": "If your brows are thick and dark, that's a good sign.",
      "seconds": 2.690612,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.216
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/b2278dec4c38.mp3",
      "hash": "b2278dec4c38",
      "vo": "A full moustache matches them and balances the face.",
      "seconds": 3.056327,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.231
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/87370b204390.mp3",
      "hash": "87370b204390",
      "vo": "It looks deliberate when it's slightly wider than your mouth.",
      "seconds": 2.742857,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.218
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/b48de38d5a02.mp3",
      "hash": "b48de38d5a02",
      "vo": "And it pairs best with a little stubble along the jaw.",
      "seconds": 2.586122,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.227
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/a599aad90f24.mp3",
      "hash": "a599aad90f24",
      "vo": "Keep it tidy: ragged edges, stray hairs and patchy regrowth look neglected.",
      "seconds": 4.310204,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.191
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/3355e25e4576.mp3",
      "hash": "3355e25e4576",
      "vo": "On a short upper lip, it crowds the nose and the mouth.",
      "seconds": 3.004082,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.226
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/d85001e5f133.mp3",
      "hash": "d85001e5f133",
      "vo": "Add light brows and a soft jaw, and nothing balances it.",
      "seconds": 2.925714,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.197
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/226d54202e4d.mp3",
      "hash": "226d54202e4d",
      "vo": "Thick looks stuck on, and thin just looks creepy on him.",
      "seconds": 2.951837,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.171
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/88fb22f8089f.mp3",
      "hash": "88fb22f8089f",
      "vo": "Because a moustache pulls the eye straight to the middle of the face.",
      "seconds": 2.925714,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.187
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/fcf75e65539c.mp3",
      "hash": "fcf75e65539c",
      "vo": "So a moustache only exaggerates what is already there.",
      "seconds": 2.690612,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.19
    },
    {
      "file": "R01/vo/7448e0fab354.mp3",
      "hash": "7448e0fab354",
      "vo": "Whether it looks better or creepy comes down to the face around it.",
      "seconds": 3.239184,
      "lead": 0,
      "trail": 0.269
    }
  ],
  "voiceSeconds": 53.826896999999974
}